  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Locally led, Inclusive and Versatile Emergency Support to Conflict Affected Populations in Ukraine and Poland (LIVES) 3.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Follow on funding from the FCDO funded &quot;Locally led, Inclusive and Versatile Emergency Support to Conflict Affected Populations in Ukraine and Poland (LIVES) 2.0&quot; program in Ukraine.The follow-on program will build upon successful implementation under LIVES, looking to scale MPCA support while further strengthening the capacity of local agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
